UGC stands for User-Generated Content.

In this context, it refers to videos created by individuals featuring a product or brand. A business may use these videos for social media promotions or advertisements.

Two approaches mentioned in the video:

A. On-camera UGC

You record yourself presenting or reviewing a product.

For example:

- Demonstrate how a product works.
- Explain its features.
- Share your experience.
- Create a short promotional video.

B. Faceless AI video advertisements

If you do not want to appear on camera, the speaker suggests using AI tools to create videos with generated visuals, narration and editing.

