Freelancing income is not the same as a fixed salary. You may spend time learning, preparing proposals and searching for clients before receiving your first payment. Platform fees, software subscriptions, taxes and payment charges may also affect your earnings.

Also, the insurance segment is a sponsored promotion within the video. Evaluate health and term insurance separately rather than treating the advertised discounts or premiums as universal.

